      "statement": "sendZeroHubMessage throws if called while isDisconnected is true, when no WebSocket exists, or when the socket exists but is not yet OPEN (a CONNECTING or CLOSING socket would otherwise make ws.send() throw a raw InvalidStateError); the error messages direct the user to reconnect via createRandomHub or joinStaticHub.",
